 106:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c **** /* Setting configENABLE_HEAP_PROTECTOR to 1 enables heap block pointers
 107:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * protection using an application supplied canary value to catch heap
 108:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * corruption should a heap buffer overflow occur.
