 112:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c **** /**
 113:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * @brief Application provided function to get a random value to be used as canary.
 114:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  *
 115:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****  * @param pxHeapCanary [out] Output parameter to return the canary value.
