 234:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****         /* Check the block size we are trying to allocate is not so large that the
 235:FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c ****          * top bit is set.  The top bit of the block size member of the BlockLink_t
